# JST_BM08B_PASS_TFT — component wrapper: local KiCad symbol + footprint, LCSC pinned in
# properties (feeds the JLC BOM/CPL fields).
#
# NEW PART (2026-09-03, Middleweight SMT-connector re-architecture). GENUINE JST PA
# 8-position 2.0mm-pitch TOP-ENTRY (vertical) SMT shrouded header with secure latch,
# BM08B-PASS-TFT(LF)(SN) - the MOTOR header {A+, A-, B+, B-, HBRK+, HBRK-, NTC, NTC_GND}. Contacts are 3A rated against the NEMA23 target of ~4A RMS: the DRIVER stage is not the rating item, this connector is - a 3A-class motor runs at full spec, a 4A motor is derated at the connector. Ben (2026-09-03) chose a connector over the brief's solder-pad option; the pads remain a build-time fallback (middleweight.zen motor_term).
#
# Why PA, vertical, SMT (Ben, 2026-09-03): no through-hole part on the two-sided
# 56.4mm board (every THT pin is a hole through BOTH faces); vertical so nothing
# protrudes past the board edge inside a motor-footprint case (a right-angle plug
# plus its wire bend wants ~15-20mm beyond the edge); PA because it is the 3A
# JST family at 2.0mm (XA's vertical SMT footprint is ~2x the area) and the same
# family the earlier THT capture used, so the crimp tooling (SPHD-001T-P0.5, AWG
# 22-28) and PAP-xxV-S housings carry over. Keying is by PIN COUNT: J-PWR 6P is
# unique (the dangerous cross-plug), J-MOT 8P is unique, J-BUS/J-IO share 5P
# (benign either way, documented in middleweight.zen).
#
# Ratings (JST PA family, ePA-F.pdf): 3A AC/DC, 250V, -25..+85C. Header 8.9mm tall,
# body 20mm wide x 5.7 deep. LCSC C489715, Extended, stock 732 @ 2026-09-03 (JLC parts API) - THIN, re-verify at order.
#
# FOOTPRINT (easyeda2kicad export, house courtyard regenerated): 8 x 1.0 x 2.7mm
# pads at 2.0mm pitch on the SOUTH edge (pin 1 at +x, i.e. the EAST end at rot 0),
# two 1.8 x 3.8mm anchor tabs on the north edge (the export carried a clone donor's name, X2000WVS-08; renamed here, geometry unchanged).
p1 = io("p1", Net, optional = True)
p2 = io("p2", Net, optional = True)
p3 = io("p3", Net, optional = True)
p4 = io("p4", Net, optional = True)
p5 = io("p5", Net, optional = True)
p6 = io("p6", Net, optional = True)
p7 = io("p7", Net, optional = True)
p8 = io("p8", Net, optional = True)
tab1 = io("tab1", Net, optional = True)
tab2 = io("tab2", Net, optional = True)

Component(
    name = "JST_BM08B_PASS_TFT",
    footprint = File("JST_BM08B_PASS_TFT/CONN-SMD_BM08B-PASS-TFT-LF-SN.kicad_mod"),
    symbol = Symbol("JST_BM08B_PASS_TFT/JST_BM08B_PASS_TFT.kicad_sym"),
    prefix = "J",
    part = Part(mpn = "BM08B-PASS-TFT(LF)(SN)", manufacturer = "JST"),
    properties = {"LCSC": "C489715", "MPN": "BM08B-PASS-TFT(LF)(SN)"},
    pins = {
        "1": p1,
        "2": p2,
        "3": p3,
        "4": p4,
        "5": p5,
        "6": p6,
        "7": p7,
        "8": p8,
        "9": tab1,
        "10": tab2,
    },
)
